flowchart TB
  M[Main assistant answer] --> S[User selected text]
  S --> A[AnchorSelection]
  A --> C[create_branch]
  C --> CT[Child Thread + BranchRecord]
  CT --> Q[Branch question]
  Q --> R{linked code project?}
  R -->|yes| RET[Hybrid Retrieval]
  R -->|no| BC
  RET --> BC[BranchContextBuilder]
  BC --> RUN[start_run child thread]
  RUN --> SSE[SSE response]
  SSE --> UI[Branch Panel]
  UI -. close does not write Main .-> M
